At this point in the garden, specimens of the forest giants of Ol'en tower 
above your head.  Mingled among them, where the surrounding glow shines through
the foliage, are the sundry fruit bearing trees that speckle the continent. 
A small, unassuming door seems to loom with greater than typical significance 
to the west.  The majesty of the trees which surround you causes you to pause
and take in the scene in all its splendor before you move along your way.
